<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3695/00  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5545/52  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7450/55  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.3480/90  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     32.03/04   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.2375/05  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1528.0/9.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.16/21  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.8767/66  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4425/40  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.9405/32  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.3991/01  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7963/68  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7355/65  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6905/15</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$369.25/369.75</p>
